-> start

=== start ===
We had gone back to fishing. Back to what we knew. We fished all night and caught nothing. Then, a man on the shore called out to us.
* [Who was it?] -> the_man

=== the_man ===
We didn't recognize him at first. He told us to throw our net on the right side of the boat. We did, and we couldn't haul it in for the number of fish.
* [Then you knew?] -> recognition

=== recognition ===
John was the first to say it: "It is the Lord!" Peter, impulsive as ever, threw on his outer garment and jumped into the water to get to him first. He was restored.
-> DONE